  "description": "In a society where euthanasia has become a part of everyday life, twenty-four-year-old Daru decides to die.\n\nHowever, before he can do so, he must spend a month in a sleep-like state, confronting his past…\n\nAs he finally faces Tan again, a mysterious figure known only as “J” intervenes, and Daru’s memories begin to take a new direction.\n\n*A revised edition of the popular series, newly edited and with updated artwork.*\n\n---\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[BookCube](https://www.bookcube.com/toon/detail.asp?webtoon_num=220058), [KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/58823789), [Ridibooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/4799000001), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=8292259), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/viva_la_vida_15)",
